     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi R-folks,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;ll be talking this Thursday at 1:10 pm about using RMarkdown and a little bit about the new <a href=\"http://rmarkdown.rstudio.com/r_notebooks.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rmarkdown.rstudio.com/r_notebooks.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467153481000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26Xv1YhoFytVKNy1dxtNIj\">RNotebooks</a> (only available via the development version of RStudio...if you want to get a copy set up before Thursday so you can follow along, please visit the RStudio website <a href=\"https://www.rstudio.com/products/rstudio/download/preview/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.rstudio.com/products/rstudio/download/preview/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467153481000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0U8TC7TG7fwMba0j9JOVee\">here</a>). I plan on demoing how you can write code, analysis, notes, manuscripts, and <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/4exeBal.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://i.imgur.com/4exeBal.gif&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467153481000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0t7XIm4R_2VMGejGV4vrUB\">even your CV</a> in RMarkdown, and provide some examples. Hopefully you may find something new and/or useful!</div><div><br></div><div>We&#39;ll have the usual work-session after. Look forward to seeing you there. </div><div><br></div><div>Adios,<br>Ryan</div><div><br></div><div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\">